        <STYLE css="font-style:italic">A <gr str="7892">Song </gr>of <gr str="4609">degrees</gr>.</STYLE> Behold, <gr str="1288">bless </gr>ye the <gr str="3068">LORD</gr>, all <STYLE css="font-style:italic">ye </STYLE>
